        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7352080?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">This change:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>adds the information that clicking an extension suggestion in the address bar (omnibox) is now a user action, including a release note.</li>
