        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Added reference to Float16Array in ImageData files]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40680</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40680"/>
        <updated>2025-08-15T17:15:11.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112591951?u=83251e0d8e8f801faef99cc68533e148a728784b&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/>
<h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>

<p dir="auto">Updated the ImageData() constructor and ImageData overview documentation to note that dataArray can be a Uint8ClampedArray or Float16Array, matching the WHATWG spec and Chromium 137+ behavior.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>

<p dir="auto">MDN previously only listed Uint8ClampedArray for dataArray, which conflicted with the spec, Chromium’s IDL, and existing examples showing Float16Array usage. This change ensures consistency across the constructor page, overview page, and spec.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>

<ul dir="auto">
<li>WHATWG spec: <a href="https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/imagebitmap-and-animations.html#imagedataarray" rel="nofollow">https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/imagebitmap-and-animations.html#imagedataarray</a></li>
<li>Chromium 137 release notes confirm Float16Array support for the constructor. <a href="https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/refs/tags/139.0.7258.9:third_party/blink/renderer/core/html/canvas/image_data.idl" rel="nofollow">https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/refs/tags/139.0.7258.9:third_party/blink/renderer/core/html/canvas/image_data.idl</a></li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="auto">Related issues and pull requests</h3>



<p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #40639.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3294051118" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40639" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/40639/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40639">#40639</a></p>
<p dir="auto">I have modified both the overview file and the constructor file.</p>
]]></content>
